  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing the Knowledge Base on Community Cohesion and Mobility Dynamics in the Context of Climate Change and Environmental Degradation through Select Country-based Case Studies within the MENA Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through research and data collection, the project aims to enhance the evidence base regarding the linkages between climate change and &#x200e;environmental degradation, community cohesion, gender dynamics and mobility decisions from a &#x200e;regional perspective, with a focus on Libya and Sudan.</narrative>
  </description>
